self.KB_CONTENT["field:750457"]={"id":"field:750457","ty":"field","sourceId":"750457","title":"結案","ver":"iGP","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"應付憑單建立作業","code":"ACP.TA026","answer":"* 此欄位僅作顯示。預設N.未結案。* 當『已付金額』等於『應付總計』時，自動預設為Y.已結案。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
